# match-online: branch coverage

Every room-level and UI branch that `match-online` (with its two rounds of fixes) added or changed, one row each: where it is, the branch in one line, and the test that fails when the branch is deleted. Each `tested` row was checked by deleting the branch on a scratch copy of the tree and running its tests; the row names the tests that failed (the deletion id says what was deleted, for rerunning). None of those edits is committed.

Rows marked `removed` are branches this round took out: dead code, or code moved into a tested function. Rows marked `equivalent` are kept, and deleting them changes nothing any player or test can observe, for the reason given. No row is `unreachable` or `untested`.

288 rows: 268 `tested`, 15 `equivalent`, 5 `removed`. Rows 286–288 come from `match-online`'s approving reviews, added by `ruins-online`.

